        "summary": "Solid Eu16 shows intense red Eu3+ luminescence under 365 nm UV, with a solid-state lifetime of 361 μs at 612 nm and a total emission quantum yield of 12.8 ± 1% (λex = 348 nm). The 5D0–7F2 intensity varies nearly linearly between 220 and 300 K. In MeCN the cluster remains intact and emits at 594, 612, 650, and 700 nm; ligand-centered absorption is red-shifted relative to free Htfac.",
